    "title": "Boyfriend avoids life sentence with plea in Allisha Watts case - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Carly Haynes, WRAL reporter ,\n13 hours ago The man charged with killing a Moore County woman is set to serve multiple years in prison as part of a plea deal reached Wednesday. James Dunmore took what's called an Alford plea deal on one count of voluntary manslaughter and one count of failure to report death by means other than natural causes in the 2023 killing of Allisha Watts. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 5",
